  // The repeat of a held arrow: nothing before `holdDelay`, then `holdRate` images per second growing to `holdRate * holdAccel` over `holdRamp` seconds (with Shift: `shiftRate` seconds per second, steady).
  // poll(now) returns the whole steps owed since the last call (the fraction is kept), so the speed does not depend on how often the screen refreshes.
